  "//engines": "Node >= 20.9.0, set by next@16 (its own engines field). Vitest additionally excludes Node 21.x and 23.x, but those are EOL non-LTS lines nobody should be on. CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) runs Node 20 and Vercel reads engines.node to pick the build runtime, so keep this range simple and in sync when bumping Next.",
